1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:03,835
为什么我们总希望有一个足够厉害的人，
Why do we keep looking for someone powerful enough

2
00:00:03,915 --> 00:00:06,604
来解决人生所有的问题？
to solve every problem in life?

3
00:00:06,684 --> 00:00:10,026
一个好领袖、好老板，或理想伴侣。
A good leader, a good boss, or the ideal partner.

4
00:00:10,106 --> 00:00:13,970
我们以为，只要找到对的人，一切就会变好。
We think the right person will make everything better.

5
00:00:14,120 --> 00:00:16,403
以色列人也这样想。
Israel thought so too.

6
00:00:16,483 --> 00:00:19,672
他们要求一个王，像其他国家一样，
They wanted a king, like the other nations,

7
00:00:19,752 --> 00:00:22,626
带领他们争战，给他们安全感。
to lead their battles and make them feel secure.

8
00:00:22,706 --> 00:00:25,864
但神在撒母耳记上八章七节说：
But in First Samuel 8:7, God said:

9
00:00:25,944 --> 00:00:28,130
因为他们不是厌弃你，
“They have not rejected you,

10
00:00:28,210 --> 00:00:30,970
乃是厌弃我，不要我作他们的王。
but they have rejected me as their king.”

11
00:00:31,120 --> 00:00:34,783
后来，扫罗成为王，却因不顺服而失败。
Saul became king, but failed through disobedience.

12
00:00:34,863 --> 00:00:38,170
神拣选大卫，但大卫同样犯罪。
God chose David, but David also sinned.

13
00:00:38,250 --> 00:00:41,441
这让我们看见：人的王再有能力，
This shows us that even the most capable human king

14
00:00:41,521 --> 00:00:43,970
也无法解决人心中的罪。
cannot solve the sin within the human heart.

15
00:00:44,120 --> 00:00:47,530
然而，神没有放弃祂的计划。
Yet God did not abandon his plan.

16
00:00:47,610 --> 00:00:51,979
祂在撒母耳记下七章十六节应许大卫：
In Second Samuel 7:16, he promised David:

17
00:00:52,059 --> 00:00:56,339
你的家和你的国必在我面前永远坚立。
“Your house and your kingdom shall endure before me.

18
00:00:56,419 --> 00:00:59,970
你的国位也必坚定，直到永远。
Your throne shall be established forever.”

19
00:01:00,120 --> 00:01:03,693
这应许最终指向耶稣基督。
This promise ultimately points to Jesus Christ.

20
00:01:03,773 --> 00:01:07,462
祂是完全顺服、为罪人舍命，
He obeyed perfectly and gave his life for sinners,

21
00:01:07,542 --> 00:01:10,970
从死里复活的永恒君王。
rising from death as the eternal King.

22
00:01:11,120 --> 00:01:14,382
所以，撒母耳记真正的问题不是：
So the real question in Samuel is not:

23
00:01:14,462 --> 00:01:16,783
谁有能力领导我们？
Who is capable of leading us?

24
00:01:16,863 --> 00:01:20,279
而是：谁真正值得我们一生信靠？
But: Who deserves our lifelong trust?

25
00:01:20,359 --> 00:01:23,970
你呢？你把生命的安全感放在谁身上？
What about you? Where do you place your security?

26
00:01:24,120 --> 00:01:27,520
这里是 SoulQuake，用圣经回应真实，
This is SoulQuake: meeting real life with Scripture,

27
00:01:27,600 --> 00:01:29,970
用真道震撼灵魂。
shaking the soul with the truth.
